{"type": "sorting", "title": "Sorting exercise — Pack it, fresh, or keep it out?", "intro": "Ten minutes. Twelve pieces of material from a People leader's workflows. Sort each into **lives in the pack**, **supplied fresh each run**, or **never enters the system**.

The pattern, stated in advance so you can test it as you sort: durable and impersonal lives in the pack; run-specific material arrives fresh and leaves with the run; anything identifying a person never becomes infrastructure.

Nothing reveals until all twelve are committed."}
